      "robos:abilities": "Universal Healing: Recover 2 Body Points once per battle. | Security Lockdown: Seal room doors for one round. | Industrial Collapse: At 3 Body Points, attack all adjacent heroes with 3 dice, then lose 1 Body Point. | Political Infighting: At \u22643 BP, roll a combat die at start of turn; on a white shield, heroes choose which available special attack it uses.",
      "dcterms:description": "El-Sayed + Rogers \u00b7 Michigan Hydra Boss \u2014 Universal Healing: Recover 2 Body Points once per battle. Security Lockdown: Seal room doors for one round. Industrial Collapse: At 3 Body Points, attack all adjacent heroes with 3 dice, then lose 1 Body Point. Universal Hydra Rule \u2014 Political Infighting: At \u22643 BP, on a white shield at turn start, heroes choose its special attack.",
