      "robos:archetype": "Texas Hydra",
      "robos:specialAbility": "Holy Smite (3 dice vs visible hero) \u2022 Indictment Barrage (move die 1-3 loses action) \u2022 Divided Authority (once/battle: lose turn, 2 dice to all adjacent heroes) \u2022 Political Infighting (\u22643 BP: white shield lets heroes pick special attack)",
      "robos:abilities": "Holy Smite: Attack a visible hero with 3 dice. | Indictment Barrage: Hero rolls movement die; 1\u20133 loses next action. | Divided Authority: Once per battle, loses its turn but attacks all adjacent heroes with 2 dice. | Political Infighting: At \u22643 BP, roll a combat die at start of turn; on a white shield, heroes choose which available special attack it uses.",
      "dcterms:description": "Talarico + Paxton \u00b7 Texas Hydra Boss \u2014 Holy Smite: Attack a visible hero with 3 dice. Indictment Barrage: Hero rolls movement die; 1\u20133 loses next action. Divided Authority: Once per battle, loses its turn but attacks all adjacent heroes with 2 dice. Universal Hydra Rule \u2014 Political Infighting: At \u22643 BP, on a white shield at turn start, heroes choose its special attack.",
